//MCQ

::Dataset Definition::
What is a Dataset in Spark?
{
    ~ A single machine collection of objects
    = A strongly typed distributed collection of domain-specific objects
    ~ A storage format like Parquet
    ~ A replacement for SparkSession
}

::Dataset vs DataFrame::
Which statement correctly describes the relationship between Dataset and DataFrame?
{
    ~ A DataFrame is strongly typed while a Dataset is not.
    = A DataFrame is an untyped view of a Dataset of Rows.
    ~ Dataset and DataFrame are completely unrelated APIs.
    ~ Dataset can only be created from RDD.
}

::Dataset Operations::
Which of the following operations can be applied to a Dataset?
{
    = map(), filter(), flatMap()
    ~ Only SQL queries
    ~ Only join operations
    ~ Only aggregation functions
}
